{
  "name": "Icy Glare",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself deals damage to you or forces you to make a Saving Throw, you can use your Reaction to force the creature to make a Wisdom Saving Throw. On a failure, the target takes 4d8 cold damage and its Speed is reduced 0 until the start of your next turn. On a success, it takes half as much damage and its Speed isn't reduced. This damage ignores Resistance.</p><p>You can use this Reaction a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
